obId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"de657626-3960-4963-9760-0efb82429a4c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270931075,"PostDateInt":1778205855000,"PostDate":"2026-05-08T10:04:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工业设计(J24922)","OrgId":700061215,"Org":"洗地机BU","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市·吴中区"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1.负责产品设计前期的市场调研，包括产品的目标使用人群，使用环境，操作习惯，消费水平等；\n2.负责产品的概念设计，与研发人员协作，规划新产品\n雏形，包括使用人群，使用场景，解决的问题，使用的方式，使用的频率等，并策划新产品，出新品策划表；\n3.负责新品的外观设计，提供多种创意方案，并对设计的产品外观做较深刻的设计说明；\n4.与研发人员合作，解决产品设计至生产过程中涉及到的产品外观问题；\n5.协助上级对部门的管理流程及管理方式进行不断优化。","Require":"1.工业设计或相关专业，本科及以上学历；海外艺术院校及各大美院优先；\n2.具备优秀项目理解能力，有坚实的产品造型设计基础；\n3.具备产品外观曲面建模能力，有一定手绘基础；\n4.对造型，色彩，工艺，表面处理有充分的感知和把握能力；\n5. 有较强的责任心，良好团队协作能力、沟通能力、谦虚踏实。","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"1年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-08T10:04:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"2978e21a-c9d8-435a-a55d-944daae564c4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270930857,"PostDateInt":1778141485000,"PostDate":"2026-05-07T16:11:25","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"智驾系统资深工程师/专家(J62081)","OrgId":700292885,"Org":"智能驾驶","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市·吴中区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"核心负责自动驾驶系统（L2+/L3级）的架构设计、集成开发与全流程技术管控，主导感知、决策、规划、控制各模块的协同优化，解决系统级技术难题，保障自动驾驶系统的安全性、稳定性与可靠性，推动系统从研发、测试到量产落地的全流程推进。\n1.系统架构设计与定义：主导自动驾驶系统整体架构设计（硬件架构、软件架构、功能架构），明确各模块（感知、决策、规划、控制、硬件适配）的接口定义、交互逻辑与技术规范，输出系统架构文档、接口协议规范，支撑系统研发落地。\n2.模块协同与集成：对接感知（雷达、摄像头等）、决策、规划、控制、硬件（域控制器、芯片）等各研发团队，推动各模块的协同开发与系统集成，解决模块间接口兼容、数据交互、功能协同等问题，确保系统整体性能达标。\n3.技术方案制定与落地：针对自动驾驶系统核心技术难题（如复杂场景下的系统响应、多传感器融合、极端工况适配等），制定可行的技术方案并推动落地；参与核心技术选型（如芯片、算法框架、传感器），评估技术可行性与落地风险。\n4.系统测试与优化：主导自动驾驶系统的测试策略、测试方案制定，协同测试团队开展系统级功能测试、性能测试、实车路测、场景化测试，跟踪测试问题，分析根因并推动整改；基于测试数据与实车反馈，持续优化系统性能、响应速度与鲁棒性。\n5.车规与合规管控：熟悉自动驾驶相关政策法规（ISO 26262、GB/T 39222等）及车规要求，主导系统功能安全、信息安全设计与验证，确保系统符合行业规范与车规标准；参与功能安全目标定义、ASIL等级评估，推动安全方案落地。\n6.技术文档与沉淀：负责自动驾驶系统相关技术文档的编制、评审与更新，包括系统架构说明书、接口规范、测试规范、技术方案等，确保文档规范性与准确性；沉淀系统研发经验，优化研发流程，推动技术复用与团队技术能力提升。","Require":"1.统招本科及以上学历，计算机科学与技术、自动化、汽车工程、电子信息工程、控制工程等相关专业；\n2.5年及以上自动驾驶系统研发相关工作经验，熟悉L2+/L4级自动驾驶系统开发流程，有完整的自动驾驶系统（感知-决策-规划-控制）研发及量产落地经验者优先；\n3.有主机厂、自动驾驶科技公司或Tier1供应商工作经验，熟悉自动驾驶硬件（雷达、摄像头、域控制器、车载芯片）、软件架构及核心算法者优先；\n4.有功能安全ISO 26262 ASIL等级项目经验，参与过系统架构设计、模块集成或实车测试落地项目者加分。\n专业技能\n5.精通自动驾驶系统工作原理，熟悉感知、决策、规划、控制各模块的核心技术与交互逻辑，能独立完成系统架构设计、接口定义与技术方案制定；\n6.具备扎实的技术功底，了解车载芯片（如NVIDIA Orin、地平线征程系列）、传感器融合技术、车载总线（CAN/LIN/以太网）及车规级开发要求；\n7.具备较强的系统集成与问题排查能力，能快速定位并解决系统级技术难题（如模块兼容性、数据交互异常、系统稳定性问题）；\n8.熟悉自动驾驶测试流程与方法，能主导系统级测试方案制定与测试结果分析，推动系统性能优化；了解功能安全ISO 26262标准，能参与安全方案设计与验证者优先；\n9.具备良好的技术文档编写能力，能独立输出系统架构文档、接口规范、技术方案等；熟练使用MATLAB/Simulink、ROS等工具者加分。","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-07T16:11:25","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"93280b25-1b83-44b3-856e-23771c19cc4e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270928805,"PostDateInt":1777373174000,"PostDate":"2026-04-28T18:46:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级餐饮运营(J61625)","OrgId":1702957,"Org":"一号孵化集群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"20K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、全面负责园区餐厅/食堂的运营管理，统筹功能区域规划、装修监督、设备采维以及环境升级与安全管理，营造安全舒适的用餐环境，实现空间利用与流程效率最大化。\n2、严控食品安全全流程，优化采购与库存，降低成本;具备一定的餐饮供应商资源，能高效对接供应商、优化采购渠道，助力成本管控与供应链稳定。\n3、结合园区需求与商务场景，科学制定并迭代菜单，确保菜品多样、营养均衡、质量达标，平衡定价与效益\n4、负责团队管理，包括招聘、培训、排班与考核，提升员工服务能力，保障运营顺畅。\n5、主导客户服务工作，处理客户反馈与投诉，快速响应突发情况;联动园区各部门，持续改进服务，提升满意度。\n6、制定成本预算并合理管控，完善规章制度，实现规范化运营。","Require":"1、28-40 岁，本科及以上学历，餐饮/酒店管理相关专业优先;持有食品安全管理员证书、健康证。\n2、5年以上大型园区/企业食堂/高端商务餐厅管理经验(综合或商务餐厅经验优先)。\n3、精通餐饮运营流程与食品安全法规，具备菜品研发、成本控制及团队管理能力。\n4、具备良好的沟通协调、问题解决能力及客户服务意识，能对接多方、处理突发情况，具备良好的抗压能力;无餐饮行业不良记录。\n5、熟练使用办公软件与餐饮管理系统，具备较强的学习能力。","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-28T18:46:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0500ac8e-eee1-44a8-9176-a6dfb3001de6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270928801,"PostDateInt":1777372094000,"PostDate":"2026-04-28T18:28:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"国际物流采购（吸尘器Bu）(J61622)","OrgId":1702957,"Org":"一号孵化集群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位描述：\n一、海运供应商与资源管理\n开拓、筛选、准入优质船公司、一级货代供应商，搭建并维护合格供应商库，定期开展履约评估、分级考核与动态淘汰，保障全球航线运力稳定供给\n深度维护核心合作方关系，洽谈长期合作协议、锁价政策及优先舱位，争取最优运价、附加费减免及服务条款，提升供应链议价权\n实时追踪全球海运市场动态、运价波动、航线调整、港口拥堵及地缘政治风险，及时输出市场分析并调整采购策略\n二、成本管控与询比价管理\n依据业务订单需求，针对整柜FCL、拼箱LCL业务开展多维度询比价、核价工作，对比航线时效、成本、舱位，制定最优物流方案\n精准核算海运全链路成本（海运费、THC、订舱费、封条费、滞箱费、目的港杂费等），建立成本管控台账，压降整体物流采购成本\n负责海运费用账单审核、明细核对，跟进开票、付款流程，处理异常费用申诉与退款，确保费用结算合规准确\n三、订舱操作与物流协同\n全权负责海运订舱全流程操作，严谨核对托书、箱型、货物品类、起运/目的港、船期等信息，杜绝订舱失误\n四、风险应对与异常处理\n快速响应并解决海运突发问题：舱位紧张、船期延误、港口滞港、清关异常、货物破损、费用争议等，降低业务损失\n建立海运风险防控体系，提前预判运价波动、运力短缺、政策变更等风险，制定应急预案，保障货物运输安全\n五、数据复盘与流程优化\n定期统计海运采购量、成本支出、运输时效、供应商履约率等数据，出具数据分析报表，为决策提供依据\n梳理优化海运采购全流程，简化操作节点、提升协同效率，持续推进成本节约与流程标准化\n六、跨部门与海外协同\n对接业务、仓库、关务、财务等部门，同步物流信息，协同完成货物出运、清关、签收闭环\n对接海外客户、代理及目的港合作方，保障末端派送、签收环节顺畅，提升客户满意度","Require":"岗位要求：\n大专及以上学历，物流管理、供应链管理、国际贸易等相关专业优先\n专员岗：1-3年国际海运采购/操作/询价实操经验；主管岗：3-5年海运采购管理经验，带过团队者优先\n精通欧美、地中海、南美、东南亚等主流海运航线，熟悉FOB/CIF/CFR等贸易术语、各类提单规则及全球港口操作规范\n具备极强的询价议价、供应商开发管理能力\n熟悉海运行业政策法规、船公司/货代运作模式，精通整柜/拼箱全流程操作逻辑","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-28T18:28:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"98385305-09f0-4616-888f-6b1276c7aad8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270925503,"PostDateInt":1776757758000,"PostDate":"2026-04-21T15:49:18","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"造型工程总布置 VSE(J60782)","OrgId":700292873,"Org":"整车集成","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市·吴中区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位定位：负责整车造型与总布置工程的一体化集成、可行性判定、冲突解决与落地管控，是造型设计、总布置、工程、法规、制造之间的核心统筹角色，确保造型创意在比例、空间、人机、法规、结构、工艺上可量产、可实现、高质量交付。\n主要工作职责：\n1、负责整车造型阶段总布置工程输入与约束定义：人机、视野、碰撞包络、硬点、通过性、安装空间、维修性等。\n2、牵头造型与总布置可行性评审：效果图、CAS、油泥模型、A 面数据的总布置校核与风险识别。\n3、统筹解决造型与总布置核心冲突：乘员空间、座椅行程、轮包、开闭件运动、管线干涉、行李舱、底盘件干涉等。\n4、负责整车比例、姿态、外廓尺寸、分缝逻辑、间隙面差、光影匹配的工程管控与交付。\n5、负责法规符合性：外凸物、灯具、视野、接近角 / 离去角、碰撞、公告 / 3C 等造型相关认证约束。\n6、跨部门协同车身、开闭件、内外饰、电子、底盘、制造、质量，推动问题闭环与变更管控。\n7、参与项目节点评审：CAS 冻结、模型验收、A 面冻结、数据发布，确保造型总布置风险提前关闭。\n8、支持试制、试装、量产阶段造型与总布置类问题整改与感知质量提升。","Require":"1、本科及以上，车辆工程、机械、工业设计等相关专业。\n2、8年及以上汽车总布置、造型工程、VSE 整车集成相关工作经验。\n3、熟悉整车开发流程、造型开发流程（Alias/CATIA）、总布置校核方法、人机法规、制造工艺。\n4、具备造型审美与工程思维，能独立完成造型可行性评估、问题判定、方案推动。\n5、熟悉间隙面差、运动校核、硬点管理、油泥 / A 面评审、感知质量标准。\n6、强沟通、强推动、强闭环，能跨部门统筹复杂问题。","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-21T15:49:18","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"1c0f7174-37ee-474f-a33f-2b17b1288af2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270920565,"PostDateInt":1775545801000,"PostDate":"2026-04-07T15:10:01","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件SE(J58874)","OrgId":1702957,"Org":"一号孵化集群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、产品需求到硬件方案的快速转化：参与产品定义阶段的技术可行性评估，主导硬件系统方案设计，包括核心器件选型、系统框图设计、成本预估和技术风险把控。\n2、核心硬件设计与调试：负责产品硬件原理图设计，指导/配合PCB Layout，并亲自参与样机的焊接、调试、测试，快速验证硬件功能与性能。\n3、软硬件协同与问题定位：配合软件/算法工程师完成底层驱动调试、系统联调，定位并解决从电源、时钟、信号完整性到系统稳定性等各类硬件问题。\n4、供应链与量产支持：参与元器件选型、BOM优化、供应商对接，确保物料的可采购性和成本竞争力；支持产品的试产、量产导入，解决生产中的硬件异常。\n5、技术文档与知识沉淀：编写硬件设计文档、调试指南、测试报告等，为团队的持续迭代积累经验。","Require":"1、学历与专业：本科及以上学历，电子、通信、自动化、计算机等相关专业。\n2、工作经验：3年以上硬件开发经验，至少完整负责过一款产品的硬件设计并成功量产（或有完整的从原型到试产的经验）。\n3、硬件设计与调试能力：\n*精通模拟/数字电路设计，熟悉主流MCU/SoC（如ARM Cortex-A/M、RISC-V、FPGA等）及其外围电路（DDR、Flash、电源、接口）。\n*熟练使用Cadence、Altium Designer等EDA工具进行原理图设计和PCB审查。\n*熟练使用示波器、逻辑分析仪、频谱仪、万用表等仪器进行故障排查，具备扎实的手工焊接能力（能焊接QFN、0402等封装）。\n4、系统思维与解决问题能力：具备较强的电路分析能力，能够快速定位硬件问题，并综合软件、结构、散热等因素提出系统级解决方案。\n5、创业心态与综合素养：\n*适应初创公司快节奏、多线程的工作方式，勇于承担职责范围外的挑战性任务。\n*具备成本意识和供应链常识，能在性能、成本、交期之间做出合理权衡。\n*良好的沟通能力和团队合作精神，能够与软件、结构、测试等部门紧密协作。\n6、加分项：\n有嵌入式底层驱动（BSP/驱动）开发或调试经验者优先。\n熟悉EMC/EMI设计、可靠性测试、安规认证流程者优先。\n有低功耗产品、物联网设备、工业控制等相关领域经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"深圳","ClassificationTwo":"研发平台","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-07T15:10:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"e834714f-8b8b-49a7-9a8a-ec68901cc296","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270920560,"PostDateInt":1775545475000,"PostDate":"2026-04-07T15:04:35","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"产品总监(J58872)","OrgId":1702957,"Org":"一号孵化集群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责根据公司的中长期战略和架构规划，制定阶段性的产品路线；\n2、熟悉行业及竞品，进行行业/市场趋势研究、市场洞察及用户研究，规划C端智能硬件（智能影像产品）的产品路线，管理产品生命周期，把控产品迭代节奏；\n3、 负责主导产品生命周期管理相关工作，包括新品类的整体布局规划、产品开发、落地实现和上市节奏把控、老产品改善，产品生命周期管理等；\n4、 负责产品团队管理、团队能力建设，善于从产品专业性、流程方法及产品意识导向层面引导团队提升产品竞争力；积极建设并形成行业具有核心竞争力的产品团队和产品力；\n5、 善于利用大数据分析和用户研究跟踪产品上线效果，发现、分析并解决问题，持续改善产品和创新；\n6、对所负责的产品部进行资源协调与管理，对经营指标达成负责。","Require":"1、本科以上，8年以上产品经理经验，其中至少3年担任手机或智能硬件行业复杂产品的产品负责人，有成功的产品规划及落地经验，有商业结果；\n2、具备专业的市场需求与分析、消费者研究、产品规划及项目管理等知识与技能；\n3、有宏观视角，能够统筹负责产品的企划和设计；敏锐的产品触觉、创新思维活跃，良好的需求分析及挖掘能力；\n4、熟悉智能硬件产品开发流程、供应链管理及市场推广，具备成熟的商业化思维与实战成果；\n5、拥有创业心态，能适应快速变化的环境，具备出色的战略规划、资源整合和跨团队领导能力；\n6、对数据敏感，能通过数据分析驱动产品决策与业务增长；\n7、良好的沟通能力，丰富的团队管理经验。","ClassificationOne":"深圳","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-07T15:04:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a5e77d28-b6b4-4112-a873-e757aeaa9938","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270920423,"PostDateInt":1775535939000,"PostDate":"2026-04-07T12:25:39","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"软件SE(J58871)","OrgId":1702957,"Org":"一号孵化集群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、研发战略与交付：制定研发规划，主导跨端架构选型，拆解影像业务任务（如采集、传输优化），跨部门协同保障核心项目按时交付，把控兼容性风险与数据安全，建复盘机制稳迭代持续对标并超越行业标杆。\n2、全面负责软件研发项目的全生命周期管理（需求分析、设计、开发、测试、集成、发布、维护）、落地 Gitflow 版本控制、CI/CD、全链路测试（含影像画质专项），建效率体系，简化流程解协作卡点，保障项目交付落地。\n3、主导解决软件开发过程中的重大技术难题和系统级问题，特别是在实时控制、高速数据采集处理、复杂算法集成、多线程/多进程协同、软硬件深度协同等方面。\n4、负责研发团队的日常管理和考核，带领研发团队完成项目开发，培养团队核心竞争力，提升团队技术水平。\n5、梳理软件团队分工与具体核心权责，前置预判研发过程风险，保障项目按节点顺利交付。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电子、计算机、软件工程等工科专业，具备10年以上研发经验，5年以上大型软件团队管理经验（带过 30 人以上团队，包括嵌入式、算法、软件、测试等大软件团队）。\n2、负责软件全周期管理、跨端架构落地经验，必须拥有至少一款成功的消费级智能硬件，从0到1的完整产品研发和上市经验，并主导其实现显著的产品功能实现和积极的市场口碑；智能影像类产品项目经验优先考虑。\n3、有复杂系统架构经验（尤其是嵌入式 + 移动端 + 云端的融合），掌握 CI/CD/ 测试体系，能攻关跨端技术难题，善转业务目标为研发计划。\n4、热爱影像类产品，能够深刻理解影像产品的用户体验与系统约束，能平衡研发与体验。\n5、具备创新意识及问题解决能力，注重结果导向；能够适应快节奏的研发环境。\n6、强领导力及跨部门沟通协调能力，具备良好的沟通协调能力和抗压能力，保障项目交付。","ClassificationOne":"深圳","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-07T12:25:39","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl"